Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:42.631%;left:84.383%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Djurgården\"><img alt=\"Djurgården\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll\">Djurgården</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:87.17%;left:25.351%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Helsingborg\"><img alt=\"Helsingborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborgs_IF\" title=\"Helsingborgs IF\">Helsingborg</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:64.384%;left:27.86%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Elfsborg\"><img alt=\"Elfsborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:64.782%;left:17.369%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Göteborg\"><img alt=\"Göteborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:64.782%;left:17.369%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Häcken\"><img alt=\"Häcken\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;top:5px;left:-3em\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:-11px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">Häcken</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:64.782%;left:17.369%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Örgryte\"><img alt=\"Örgryte\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;left:-11px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:43.3%;left:84.417%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hammarby\"><img alt=\"Hammarby\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;top:5px;left:-3em\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:3px;left:11px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:1.432%;left:75.837%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Sundsvall\"><img alt=\"Sundsvall\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:6px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:52.917%;left:63.44%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Norrköping\"><img alt=\"Norrköping\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:6px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">Norrköping</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:78.589%;left:27.103%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Halmstad\"><img alt=\"Halmstad\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:6px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:96.145%;left:30.339%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Trelleborg\"><img alt=\"Trelleborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:43.701%;left:53.001%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Örebro\"><img alt=\"Örebro\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:93.431%;left:28.453%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Malmö\"><img alt=\"Malmö\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" tit